      <description>
            &lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/1/7/5/1754778da1c6c28ef8ca8ac377460721c8437fd0.png&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/3knWZJuTTtnFkoQFuXjsyIs6xIk.png?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;图片&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/1/7/5/1754778da1c6c28ef8ca8ac377460721c8437fd0.png&quot; alt=&quot;图片&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;3knWZJuTTtnFkoQFuXjsyIs6xIk&quot; width=&quot;690&quot; height=&quot;246&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;EAF8F0&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;平台地址：&lt;a href=&quot;https://beta.spiritlhl.net/&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;https://beta.spiritlhl.net/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;源码开源地址：&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/oneclickvirt/oneclickvirt&quot; class=&quot;inline-onebox&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;GitHub - oneclickvirt/oneclickvirt: Universal Virtualization Management Platform 可扩展的通用虚拟化管理平台，支持 Proxmox VE / LXD (GPU) / Incus (GPU) / Docker / Podman / Containerd / Qemu / Kubevirt · GitHub&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;欢迎仓库点一个star免费支持&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;不要直接点首页的注册，直接点登录进入使用第三方登录注册使用Linuxdo的认证，默认公开注册已关闭&lt;/p&gt;
